WEBVTT

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.840
"Chu"

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.840
No way--is <i>that</i>--

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.970
Did he really finish off Lin Fang
from that distance?

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.390
This is much too dangerous.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.020
Sir! The enemy is nearly upon us!

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.350
Fight them off with arrows. Fire at will!

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.100
Fire!

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.520
Use your spears on the man in the cart!

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.860
What the hell are you doing?!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.160
The commander in the crested helmet--

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.530
get him!

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.330
No--

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.130
Take <i>that</i>!

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.130
"Le"

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.130
Meng Tian!

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.640
"Yu"

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.070
You're in the way. Move.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.540
"A Mutual Self-Confidence"

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.130
This spearman...

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.220
Archers, move away from crowded areas!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.270
Call over the heavy cavalry
and infantry on the right!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.770
Sir!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.440
Sorry you went through
all that trouble to save me.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:13.270
Don't be stupid.
I'm after their main camp.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:17.280
Let's go, Yu Feng Force!
We're breaking through!

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.070
Idiot! Like we're gonna let <i>that </i>happen!

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.990
And <i>you</i>, while I'm at it!

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:29.290
Tch! Dodged again?

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:30.290
Ben!

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:33.790
Tch!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.960
How dare you attack Lord Ben!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.550
Xiang Yi, sir!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.300
"Xiang"

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.890
So you finally showed up,
you damn dullards!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.060
Our two squads'll present
a united front, as always!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:53.270
Leave the hand-to-hand combat to my men!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:59.280
You take half the heavy cavalry
and infantry and fight from behind!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:02.280
All remaining troops,
fight on Xiang Yi's orders!

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:06.660
These are tough enemies, Yi!
Use a support formation!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.240
I know that!

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.000
Two squads, teaming up? That was fast!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.580
They're pretty used to it.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.040
You know, we've got some 500
of the Le Hua Force here.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.840
Wanna join forces?

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.210
No.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.920
All right! This is getting interesting.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.550
I'd say it's time for it
to make its appearance!

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.100
I refer, of course, to...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.020
...the legendary Moye!

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:36.520
The... the Moye sword?!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.740
Well, <i>that </i>got everyone's attention.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.200
Th-The magical Moye...

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.710
Magical?

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.670
A sword imbued so deeply
with the powerful sentiments

00:04:56.670 --> 00:05:00.550
of Gan Jiang and Mo Ye, husband-and-wife
swordsmiths beset by misfortune,

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.590
that it is said to have a soul.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.300
There is nothing that sword cannot cut,

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.300
and the wounds it leaves will never close.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.600
What?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.850
Legends are always embellished.

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:20.400
On the other hand, this legend
sprang from a seed of truth.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.070
Too much to handle alone, Wang Ben?

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:26.660
Don't be stupid. It's just one sword.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.240
True enough.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.410
Okay, then--he's all yours.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.960
I'll take down that archer fellow.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.830
Let's go, Le Hua Force!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:42.250
That bastard--he's dead set
on takin' down Li.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.130
Well, whatever--

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:49.090
he'll be shot dead before he
gets anywhere near the man.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:53.560
I'm gonna destroy this
strangely snooty simpleton...

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.230
...with Moye, that is!

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.770
Bring it on, you southern ape.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.900
I'll snap that sword in two.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.660
"Chu"
"Lin"
"Qin"

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.790
Sir!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.450
Lu Wuwei, sir!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:21.000
You were a tough one. It's been a while
since I've been this wounded.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:27.590
I-Incredible! Lu Wuwei--he's--

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.760
They say each army's commander
has general-caliber skill...

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.310
...but Chu's general here...

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:38.190
General-caliber, eh? Don't make me laugh.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:41.310
You Qin monkeys! Don't speak of generals!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:45.440
Hell, same goes for Zhao and Wei,
those lumps in the middle,

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:48.820
and for Qi and Yan on the outskirts!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:53.990
What you and the great land of Chu call
a general are two very different things!

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:58.040
We differ in territory size!
In population!

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:02.130
Thus the size of our competing
underclass differs, too!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.420
But there's little difference
in the number of our generals.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.920
Do you understand?

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:11.510
Only the smallest fraction of a fraction
become generals in Chu!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:16.390
"Teng"

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:16.390
Chu's generals are equivalent
to your <i>great </i>generals!

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.520
"Qin"

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.520
What?!

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:24.480
And I, Lord Linwu, am the sole
commander of <i>three </i>armies!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:25.980
You! Wang Yi's leftovers!

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.690
If you want a <i>proper </i>battle with me,

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:33.950
you'd best drag Wang Yi, one of the Six
Great Generals, out of his grave!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.740
Why, you...

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.040
How dare you!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:43.880
You picked the wrong foe, Lu Wuwei.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.460
Time for me to crush that skull of--

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.710
"Lin"

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.710
Hmm?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.220
What the hell is that?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:03.810
Trembling with anticipation? Me?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.440
Haven't felt this way for a long time.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.570
So Qin has someone, too!

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.530
Someone <i>amusing</i>!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.080
It appears Teng himself has made a move.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:22.750
We've already reached a point that could
greatly turn the tide of this battle.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:26.170
Yes. But Lord Linwu is formidable indeed.

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.340
Sir, are you sure about this?

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:41.390
My, but it's been a while, Meng Wu.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.310
And how have you been, hmm?

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.070
Tch.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.730
So? What was it you wanted to talk about?

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.070
Hey.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.660
All right. I'll stop.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:09:02.620
Your strategy was exactly the same
as the one we'd thought up:

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.290
You go after their first army,

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:10.380
then we swoop in and strike
the second and third.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:18.220
The problem with that is whether your
men can actually <i>hit </i>Chu's first army.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.140
How confident are you?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:24.560
There's no point speaking
of such indefinite matters.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:25.850
What?

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:31.650
Instead, here's something
that's for certain, Meng Wu:

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:37.160
The death of our lord, the great Wang Yi,
has made you stronger.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.580
And I? I have been strong all along.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.750
Those are indisputable facts.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:48.790
If anything can be said about this battle,

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.040
it's that and that alone.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.130
Stop them!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:00.350
Are you sure about this, sir?

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.760
I don't give a damn
about that man's might.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.310
All I know...

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:12.610
...is that he's a man who had
Wang Yi's approval.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:17.030
He's...

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:17.990
...so fast!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:19.360
A different stance?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:41.600
T-To go from a dead stop to striking
the massive General Teng so easily...

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:48.100
What's more, I've never seen anyone
stop the general's sword before.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.360
Chu's general really is something else!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:10.080
Dammit! I can't get in close
enough to this joker!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.330
Xiang Yi!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.750
Shut up! You're distractin' me!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:19.300
Our main base--our general
is battling one of theirs!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.380
Say <i>what</i>?

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.140
That flag says "Teng," all right.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:26.270
And Teng's another Qin general!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:31.310
If they're comin' out to us, they're right
where Lord Linwu wants them.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.600
Leave 'em be!

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:35.270
Our general hardly needs help!

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:40.280
Besides, rush in there all willy-nilly
and we'll have this spearman after us!

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:44.410
You don't know the first thing
about Lord Linwu.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.200
The south of the Middle Kingdom
is home to the savage tribe

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.750
known as the Baiyue.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:53.330
That was our battlefield
for many long years.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.090
With his main camp out in front,
Lord Linwu would lure in the foe;

00:11:56.090 --> 00:12:01.550
if he spotted a dauntless general,
he'd kill him with his own hands.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:04.180
It was one battle after another,

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:08.390
and the one general who clawed
his way through intense competition

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.980
was Lord Linwu.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:14.400
You can't take him down
like any other general!

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.070
If you face him head-on...

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:20.240
...you will <i>never </i>defeat him.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.120
No... it can't be!

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.240
What on earth...

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.160
Lord Linwu is being
thoroughly overpowered!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.670
General, sir!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:38.840
Impossible...

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:45.590
Who... who the hell <i>are </i>you?!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.720
One of the world's greatest generals!

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.900
You? Not exactly.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.630
Yes, you're strong.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:18.840
Still...

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:23.510
<i>I </i>have climbed the ranks to become
general of the mighty nation of Chu!

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.180
And I've done so

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:30.600
by destroying strong men like <i>you</i>
time and time again!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:37.940
Red Frock's squad is closing in!
Keep them at a distance!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.110
Sir!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.480
And don't forget to assist Xiang Yi's men!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:42.860
Sir!

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:48.070
<i>Where </i>is my platform?! I need higher
ground if I'm going to attack!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.410
I'm worried about our main camp, too.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:56.830
Li... you protect him with that
bow of yours, all right?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.170
Understood.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.500
My sister...

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.760
The platform's here!

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.380
Clear a path!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.560
I'll end this with two shots!

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.440
One is for the man fighting Yi.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:24.440
But first, I'll take aim at the
bastard harassing my general...

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.690
...and <i>kill </i>him!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.070
Damn you, Red Frock!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:36.910
I failed!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.750
--Sir!
--Protect Commander Li!

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.380
Damn it all...

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:58.060
H-He's overpowering General Teng!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.440
To think Lord Linwu was this mighty...

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.770
You idiot. It's the other way around.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:03.860
Sir?

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:08.530
Teng's not being overpowered--
he's stopping each blow head-on.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.530
Huh?

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:24.460
Inconceivable... How is my strength
not getting the job done?

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:29.630
This strength let me stay wide open
in fights with fierce foes on my way up!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:39.060
And <i>this </i>man merely fought in
the shadow of Wang Yi's umbrella!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:43.110
Have you not considered the artistry
in always upholding that umbrella?

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.990
You may have absolute
confidence in your own power,

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.990
hard-won on the front lines.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.660
But <i>I</i>...

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.790
...have the confidence of having supported
the great general Wang Yi,

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.120
recognized throughout the Middle Kingdom!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.180
Who gives a damn about your confidence?!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:15.550
If we'd been of the same generation,
I'd have taken Wang Yi down, too!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.640
The only ones fit to become
the greatest generals in the world

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.640
are the generals of Chu!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.190
Wrong.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:38.740
You don't have what it takes.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.200
Bai Cui...

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:47.500
Don't push yourself too hard, now.
I mean, becoming a great general?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.800
Why not? Didn't you marry me
because I promised as much?

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:58.470
That's not why. It's because I...

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.780
You were powerful--I'll give you that.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.410
I haven't shed this much blood
in quite a while.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:30.050
May you raise a glass in the afterworld
with Tong Jin, Ling Fang, and Lu Wuwei.

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:40.470
--Our g-general!
--Dammit!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.350
Wait--was <i>I </i>on that list?

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:49.310
What's with all the commotion?

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.270
Tch.

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.150
Lord Linwu...

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:58.570
All right!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.250
Lord Linwu's been killed?!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.250
Yes, sir.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.380
So that's why the left-hand
battlefield was so worked up.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.750
Ol' Baldy really screwed up.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.550
The sun is already setting.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:16.340
Retaliation will have to wait
till tomorrow at the earliest.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:17.890
I suppose so.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.720
B-Begging your pardon...

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:22.260
The messenger corps is
debating getting this message

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.640
to the other armies as well.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.270
No need.

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.440
They've already known for ages.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.240
"Wei"

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.360
Lord Chunshen was right:

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:41.410
Word of Lord Linwu's death in battle
reached each coalition army

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.740
"Han"

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.740
in the blink of an eye,

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.540
because each general had set up
his own intelligence network

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:49.080
"Yan"

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:49.080
because each general had set up
his own intelligence network

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:52.880
to report on the other battlefields.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:57.260
Say what? A Chu general's dead? Already?

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.590
Well, <i>that </i>didn't take long!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:02.430
The Chu army screwed up--and they
were the cockiest one around!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:09.730
Naturally, the news also reached this
battleground on the very outskirts.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:14.150
But the soldiers there
couldn't afford to react.

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:19.950
First sunset, then these dust clouds...

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:24.450
I can't see Lord Biao's army
<i>or </i>the Fei Xin Force!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.710
We should pull back a little further,
He Liao Diao.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:33.170
The enemy could show up at any moment!

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:35.460
This melee has gone on too long.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.670
The troops are all out of formation,

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:41.050
fighting scattered throughout that mess.

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.470
We're going in!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.520
We'll reform the squads from within!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.430
Wha--that's ridiculous!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:52.100
Are you <i>insane</i>, He Liao Diao?! Wait--

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.190
Dammit!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:56.530
Fine! Let's go! Protect our tactician!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:02.530
It's no use! I can't find <i>anyone</i>,
much less Xin!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:06.660
The others must have gotten separated
during this long skirmish.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:09.410
We can only hope to run into them,
like you and I did.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.040
If we go around shouting
for our squadmates,

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:15.090
we'll probably run into an enemy
corps and be slaughtered.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:18.960
And the troops we're fighting now...
they ain't right.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:29.600
Run!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.940
We fight!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.480
Our numbers are similar.

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:37.020
Take them head-on instead
of getting shot in the back!

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.570
Let's... let's do this, gang!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:45.240
Xin... I sure hope you're okay!

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.500
This guy...

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.090
Don't you know when to <i>quit</i>?!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.680
That kid's got incredible strength.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:08.720
Why, you...

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.690
Sergeant Song Zuo, sir, what <i>is </i>all this?

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.150
No matter how many times
we pierce these foes...

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.610
Like I know!

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:24.990
Zhao's troops have always faced the Qin
army with an unusual fighting spirit...

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.950
But I've never seen
anyone like this before.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.450
Right.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.870
Dammit...

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.960
I keep fightin' through, but that
white-haired guy is always just

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.120
"Zhao"

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.120
out of reach.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:40.170
Didn't expect these soldiers
to be so damn tenacious!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:42.380
Quit givin' me the stink eye!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:48.930
Song Zuo! Round up the infantry
and bring 'em over here!

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:51.180
Y-You're going back in?!

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.480
Bring Lord Biao's men, too!
We're charging in!

00:21:56.940 --> 00:22:00.570
Like I'm gonna give up.
That general's head is <i>mine</i>!

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:02.400
"Xin" "Wan Ji"

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:03.440
"Li Bai"

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:08.370
Wan Ji's army certainly
is dreadful to behold.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:10.740
There's no room for us to move in.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:13.910
They <i>would </i>be more ferocious
when up against Qin.

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:17.750
Wan Ji's army is a little different
from the other Zhao armies.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:23.840
One of Qin's six great generals, Bai Qi,

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.970
buried 400 thousand surrendered
soldiers alive at Changping.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:32.930
The Zhao people's grudge against
Qin will never be wiped clean.

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:35.310
That's the way! Almost there!

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:37.480
W-We'll make it this time!

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:41.480
What's more...

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:43.030
Move!

00:22:43.030 --> 00:22:45.690
All right! Made it through!

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.570
"Wan"

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.570
...Wan Ji's army consists only of the
families the Changping dead left behind.

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:56.660
They are the curse of
Changping made flesh.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:57.710
Wha--

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.710
Can... can you feel it, b-boy,

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:05.590
you... s-son of Qin?

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:12.050
C-Can you feel... our <i>darkness</i>?

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:58.620
Next time on <i>Kingdom</i>:
"A Wasteland Riddled with Holes."
